@startuml domain-catalog
title Domain model (1/3): catalog and content
hide empty methods
hide circle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "Catalog" {
  class Program {
    slug : string
    title : string
    locale : string
    status : ProgramStatus
    pack_version : string
  }

  class Station {
    position : int
    kind : StationKind
    title : string
    config : map
  }

  class Segment {
    key : string
    label : string
    description : text
    default_path : Path
    position : int
    archived_at : datetime
  }

  class Qualification {
    code : string
    title : string
    audience : text
    unlocks : string[]
    add_on : boolean
    validity_kind : ValidityKind
    validity_months : int
    refresher_mode : RefresherMode
    phases : Phase[]
    archived_at : datetime
  }

  class Requirement {
    kind : RequirementKind
    target_key : string
  }

  class Module {
    number : int
    title : string
    summary : text
    phases : Phase[]
    domains : string[]
    single_path : boolean
    refresher_unit : boolean
    areas_elsewhere : map
    archived_at : datetime
  }

  class LearningObjective {
    key : string
    statement : text
    area : CompetenceArea
    depth : Depth
    phase : Phase
    domain : string
    position : int
    archived_at : datetime
  }

  class Lesson {
    key : string
    position : int
    title : string
    archived_at : datetime
  }

  class Block {
    position : int
    kind : BlockKind
    body : markdown
    provenance : Provenance
    collapsed_on : Path[]
    placeholder_key : string
  }

  class Rule {
    number : int
    statement : text
    action : text
    archived_at : datetime
  }

  class Item {
    key : string
    kind : ItemKind
    stem : markdown
    core : boolean
    phase : Phase
    provenance : Provenance
    config : map
    position : int
    archived_at : datetime
  }

  class Option {
    key : string
    label : text
    correct : boolean
    feedback : markdown
    position : int
  }

  class Assessment {
    key : string
    title : string
    kind : AssessmentKind
    counts_for_credential : boolean
    max_wrong : int
    core_required : boolean
    archived_at : datetime
  }

  class CompanionFormat {
    key : string
    title : string
    description : text
    phases : Phase[]
    attendance_counts : boolean
    position : int
    archived_at : datetime
  }

  class GlossaryTerm {
    slug : string
    label : string
    short_text : text
    archived_at : datetime
  }

  class Source {
    key : string
    title : string
    publisher : string
    url : string
    edition_date : date
    retrieved_on : date
    kind : SourceKind
    archived_at : datetime
  }

  class Citation {
    locator : string
  }
}

Program "1" *-- "0..*" Station
Program "1" *-- "0..*" Segment
Program "1" *-- "0..*" Qualification
Program "1" *-- "1..*" Module
Program "1" *-- "0..*" CompanionFormat
Program "1" *-- "0..*" GlossaryTerm
Program "1" *-- "0..*" Source

Station "0..*" --> "0..1" Module : shows

Qualification "1" *-- "1..*" Requirement
Qualification "0..*" --> "0..*" Qualification : prerequisite
Requirement ..> Module : module_completed
Requirement ..> Assessment : assessment_passed
Requirement ..> CompanionFormat : attendance

Module "1" *-- "1..*" Lesson
Module "1" *-- "0..*" LearningObjective : topic objectives
LearningObjective "0..*" --> "0..*" Lesson : taught in
Item "0..*" --> "0..*" LearningObjective : practises or\nprovides evidence for
CompanionFormat "0..*" --> "0..*" LearningObjective : anchors
Module "1" *-- "0..*" Rule
Module "1" *-- "0..*" Assessment

Lesson "1" *-- "1..*" Block
Lesson "1" *-- "0..*" Item : practice
Assessment "1" o-- "1..*" Item : questions

Item "1" *-- "0..*" Option
Item "0..*" --> "0..*" Rule : refers to
Item "0..*" --> "0..*" Lesson : reveals on wrong answer

Block "1" o-- "0..*" Citation
Rule "1" o-- "0..*" Citation
Item "1" o-- "0..*" Citation
Citation "0..*" --> "1" Source

note right of Qualification
  unlocks lists the tasks a credential
  for this qualification permits.
  The model holds no rank, score or
  level of the person.
end note

note bottom of Assessment
  Pass rule: a wrong core item fails the attempt.
  Otherwise the attempt passes when the number of
  wrong answers is at most max_wrong.
end note

note top of LearningObjective
  Constructive alignment per topic (domain rule 14):
  1. Every objective has a teaching lesson and evidence
     (an item of an assessment, a practice item with
     a correct answer, a checklist drill, or a companion
     format whose attendance counts).
  2. Every item of an assessment that counts for a
     credential provides evidence for an objective.
  3. Every module covers the four CORE areas or names
     in areas_elsewhere where a missing area is covered.
  4. The evidence kind fits the depth (always a warning).
  With alignment: strict, checks 1 to 3 are errors.
  With alignment: warn, they are warnings, so an
  objective can lack a teaching lesson. A module
  without objectives.yaml has no objectives.
  The learner's status per objective is derived from
  the learner's own records. No table stores it per person.
end note

note right of Item
  config by kind:
  slot_builder: slots, options per slot, feedback per option
  classification: cases, categories, expected mapping
  checklist_drill: required checks and initials before release
  poll: options without a correct answer
end note

note left of Station
  config holds station texts from the pack:
  the self-assessment question, the feedback
  questions, intro text for overview, credential
  and companion format stations.
end note

note right of Block
  collapsed_on: paths on which the block starts
  collapsed (for example explanations on the
  short path). No lesson is skipped on any path.
  placeholder_key: binds the block to a policy
  that the organization maintains (see 2/3).
end note

note left of Module
  Keyed rows (segments, modules, lessons, learning
  objectives, rules, items, assessments, qualifications,
  companion formats, glossary terms, sources) carry
  archived_at.
  A publish sets it on every row whose key the pack
  no longer contains and clears it on rows that
  return. Learner read paths skip archived rows.
end note

note left of Requirement
  kind policy_acknowledged targets a Policy,
  kind qualification_held targets a Qualification
  (see 2/3 for Policy).
end note
@enduml
